437 0 obj
  << /ActualText (PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nI am a UX\057UI Designer who believes that great design happens when we simplify complex systems at scale\056 I approach product design with curiosity and a focus on the human on the other side of the screen\204whether they are navigating a high\055volume enterprise portal or applying for their first job\056 I thrive in rigorous design critiques\054 synthesizing qualitative and quantitative data to build interfaces that are trustworthy\054 accessible\054 and intentional\056 I partner closely with product management and engineering to design for edge cases\054 low\055confidence states\054 and failure modes\054 ensuring that every user interaction feels purposeful\054 legible\054 and in control\056\n\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\nModicare \174 Modi Enterprises\nUI\057UX \046 Design Intern \174 New Delhi\054 India \174 Mar 2026 \205 Sep 2026\n\nSpearheaded UI\057UX design initiatives for enterprise\055level application and website redesigns\054 navigating technical constraints to simplify complex user flows and reduce friction\056\nBuilt and maintained a scalable design system in Figma\054 standardizing 50\053 reusable components to ensure visual consistency across high\055volume digital touchpoints\056\nPartnered closely with cross\055functional development teams\054 delivering interactive prototypes and detailed design specifications that accounted for edge cases\054 error states\054 and clear system feedback\056\nCollaborated on visual assets for digital and physical platforms utilizing Adobe Creative Suite and Figma\056\n\nHVP Pharmaceutical\nDesign Intern \174 Rohini\054 Delhi\054 India \174 May 2025 \205 Jul 2025\n\nDesigned accessible\054 user\055centric packaging solutions within strict industry regulations\054 translating complex requirements into legible\054 trustworthy interactions for the end user\056\nIterated on design concepts based on cross\055team critiques and stakeholder feedback\054 balancing business goals with human\055centered design principles\056\n\nArchitecture Design Studio\nDesign Intern \174 New Delhi\054 India \174 May 2024 \205 Jul 2024\n\nApplied core principles of human\055centered design to physical environments\054 assisting in layout planning and spatial optimization to improve usability\056\nProduced technical mockups and physical prototypes to clearly communicate design rationale\054 benefits\054 and trade\055offs to clients and lead architects\056\n\nRedtape Pvt\056 Ltd\056\nDesign Intern \174 Noida\054 Uttar Pradesh\054 India \174 May 2023 \205 Jul 2023\n\nSynthesized qualitative and quantitative market data to inform the development of commercially viable consumer products\056\nDesigned retail collateral\054 utilizing customer feedback to iterate on visual patterns and enhance end\055user engagement\056\n\nOTHER UX PROJECTS\n\nEnterprise Web Portal Redesign \174 UX\057UI Designer\nDeveloped comprehensive wireframe concepts\054 intuitive layout structures\054 and typography style guides in Figma for a centralized internal platform\056\nBuilt interactive component states to clearly communicate intended workflows and interface behaviors to stakeholders\056\n\nB2C E\055Commerce Mobile Application \174 UX\057UI Designer\nCreated wireframes and user flows for a local retailer\047s digital storefront to streamline the mobile ordering experience\056\nDesigned responsive UI components to ensure accessibility and cross\055device usability\056\n\nGoogle UX Certification Capstone Project \174 UX\057UI Designer\nConducted foundational user research\054 competitive audits\054 and usability testing to design an end\055to\055end mobile application addressing a core user pain point\056\nDelivered a complete case study including journey maps\054 low\055fidelity paper wireframes\054 and a high\055fidelity clickable prototype in Figma\056\n\nEDUCATION\n\nAmity University \174 Noida\054 Uttar Pradesh\054 IndiaBachelor of Product Design \174 CGPA\072 8\05685 \174 Sep 2022 \205 Jul 2026\n\nCERTIFICATIONS\n\nGoogle UX Design Professional Certificate\054 Coursera\nNPTEL Online Certification\055 Design\054 Technology and Innovation\n\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\n\nUX\057UI \046 Research\072 End\055to\055End Product Design\054 User Research\054 Wireframing\054 Information Architecture \050IA\051\054 Usability Testing\054 User Journey Mapping\054 Lo\055Fi \046 Hi\055Fi Prototyping\054 Design Systems\054 Accessibility\nTools\072 Figma\054 Adobe Creative Suite \050Photoshop\054 Illustrator\054 InDesign\051\054 Canva\054 CapCut\054 AutoCAD\054 Generative AI \050Midjourney\051\056\nSoft Skills\072 Cross\055functional Collaboration\054 Stakeholder Communication\054 Problem\055Solving\054 Empathy\056\n\nLANGUAGES \n\nEnglish \050Fluent\051\054 Hindi \050Native\051\054 German \050Beginner\051)
     /K [ 5 ]
